Not really unless it gets cursed, but may as well wish it blessed.

> It also says wish for an uncursed magic marker.  Why not blessed? (I'm
> thinking so you can write cursed scrolls...)

Bless a stack of 15+ paper, the marker will write blessed on them and
cursed on cursed scrolls.

> So what should I wish for? I have 3 after recharging. (It came with just 1)
> (what do I need to ascend - in about 10 years I've only ascended 3 Valks
