> Tools:
> Bell of Opening
> 10 tallow candles
> 2 blessed unicorn horns
> 3 blessed bags of Holding
> pick-axe/key/towel/blindfold/lantern
>
> Stashed:
> Firebane/frostbane/graswandir/excaliber/trollsbane

Those first 4 weapons are vastly preferrable to the Tsurugi; any of
them #twoweaponed with your starting katana (or a longsword) will do a
lot more damage.

Grayswandir is the best weapon in the game.  Excalibur is pretty
close, snickersnee and stormy are also great, firebrand and frosty are
also good but can destroy potions and stuff.

> 10 holy water
> lots of lame scrolls light/blank/teleport/punish/confuse

Teleport aren't lame, they're great on the ascent.  And cursed
teleport are extremely valuable, you can skip most of Rodney's tower
and the Sanctum with them.

> I plan to wish for: Amulet of Lifesaving  that leaves 2 wishes.

If you're dead-set on "oLS, you want SDSM and a cloak of magic
resistance.

Too bad you have so many artifacts, something like the Magic Mirror or
Orb of Detection would give MR and leave the robe slot open.

The next wish should be a magic marker to get ?enchant armor and make
sure you have enough gold detection.



